# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UNSW-NB15 is a 48 MB public dataset that anyone can re-fetch with
#     python -m src.data_loader
# so it is not committed. The .gitkeep files preserve the directory structure,
# and reports/dataset_documentation.md records the SHA-256 of the exact files
# used to produce the committed results.
data/raw/*
data/interim/*
data/processed/*
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/**/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Models
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Serialised estimators are large (tens to hundreds of MB) and are a build
# product of `python -m src.train`. The small JSON artefacts that record WHICH
# model and threshold were chosen ARE committed, because they are the record of
# the experiment rather than its output.
models/*.joblib
models/*.pkl
!models/.gitkeep
!models/*.json

